WEBVTT

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.096
LT: I look for someone
who has a sense of fun,

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:03.096
who's audacious,

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.576
who's forthcoming, who has politics,

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:11.456
who has even a small scrap
of passion for the planet,

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:14.096
someone who's decent,
has a sense of justice

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.216
and who thinks I'm worthwhile.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.216
(Laughter)

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:21.000
(Applause)

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:24.776
JF: You know, I was thinking this morning,

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.616
I don't even know what I would do
without my women friends.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:30.656
I mean it's, "I have my friends,
therefore I am."